{"4202540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Anhedonia: Sanctuary of Ash", "steam_appid": 4202540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4882470], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202540/extras/0baaa309f3df176f3add796bede6046d.avif?t=1787776832\" width=1200 height=564 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202540/extras/e56e33a9e43e17f2c38d16ae4162ce30.webp?t=1787776832\" width=1199 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demons tore through the earth, dragging countless humans into the abyss while others were left wandering as hollowed bodies possessed by ancient hunger. Villages lie silent beneath drifting ash, and the world is ruled by shadows that wear human shapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202540/extras/e56e33a9e43e17f2c38d16ae4162ce30.webp?t=1787776832\" width=1199 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202540/extras/c13c1dca33ffbc9e784809b4c9fb7e6d.avif?t=1787776832\" width=1200 height=562 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202540/extras/e56e33a9e43e17f2c38d16ae4162ce30.webp?t=1787776832\" width=1199 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But the land does not welcome the living.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are scarce, the possessed strike without warning, and the corruption spreads with every passing night. To return alive is to defy the world itself — and every survivor rescued or relic recovered becomes a small victory against the coming oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redemption lies in the Sanctuary of Ash — if you survive long enough to build it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202540/extras/e56e33a9e43e17f2c38d16ae4162ce30.webp?t=1787776832\" width=1199 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202540/extras/8f04f79b793293cfd1a4fbd83c50cd56.avif?t=1787776832\" width=1200 height=562 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brutal Third-Person Melee Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight demonic horrors and possessed humans using weighty, grounded melee combat. Master dodges, stamina, and timing — every encounter during the expedition is deadly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exorcise the Damned</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the possessed can still be saved.<strong> </strong>Perform exorcisms to cleanse corrupted souls and recruit survivors to aid your growing Sanctuary.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebuild the Sanctuary of Ash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return survivors to the monastry ruins and slowly transform them into a functioning settlement. <br>Upgrade buildings, assign roles, and unlock new abilities, gear, and blessings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extraction Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition is a high-risk journey into hostile territory.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world to gather resources, rescue the possessed, and find master-quality gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extract</strong> safely or lose everything. Escape the cursed lands before they take your sanity and soul.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage Edgar’s wounds, sanity, and fading stamina while navigating cursed zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202540/extras/96c2b9ece347178c0945d9b88338ffbc.avif?t=1787776832\" width=1200 height=564 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Tale of Guilt, Faith, and Redemption</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunted by guilt and shaken faith, Edgar pushes deeper into a world consumed by corruption. As whispers of an approaching evil spread and the cult prepares for its arrival, he must uncover the truth behind the catastrophe, confront those responsible, and save whoever can still be saved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202540/extras/e56e33a9e43e17f2c38d16ae4162ce30.webp?t=1787776832\" width=1199 height=35 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202540/extras/ee1ffd43247554d3141b9c6a92764414.avif?t=1787776832\" width=1200 height=304 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202540/extras/e56e33a9e43e17f2c38d16ae4162ce30.webp?t=1787776832\" width=1199 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202540/extras/0baaa309f3df176f3add796bede6046d.avif?t=1787776832\" width=1200 height=564 /></span></p><p class=\"