tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202540/extras/e56e33a9e43e17f2c38d16ae4162ce30.webp?t=1787776832\" width=1199 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202540/extras/8f04f79b793293cfd1a4fbd83c50cd56.avif?t=1787776832\" width=1200 height=562 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brutal Third-Person Melee Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight demonic horrors and possessed humans using weighty, grounded melee combat. Master dodges, stamina, and timing — every encounter during the expedition is deadly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exorcise the Damned</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the possessed can still be saved.<strong> </strong>Perform exorcisms to cleanse corrupted souls and recruit survivors to aid your growing Sanctuary.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebuild the Sanctuary of Ash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return survivors to the monastry ruins and slowly transform them into a functioning settlement. <br>Upgrade buildings, assign roles, and unlock new abilities, gear, and blessings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extraction Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition is a high-risk journey into hostile territory.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world to gather resources, rescue the possessed, and find master-quality gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extract</strong> safely or lose everything. Escape the cursed lands before they take your sanity and soul.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage Edgar’s wounds, sanity, and fading stamina while navigating cursed zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202540/extras/96c2b9ece347178c0945d9b88338ffbc.avif?t=1787776832\" width=1200 height=564 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Tale of Guilt, Faith, and Redemption</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunted by guilt and shaken faith, Edgar pushes deeper into a world consumed by corruption. As whispers of an approaching evil spread and the cult prepares for its arrival, he must uncover the truth behind the catastrophe, confront those responsible, and save whoever can still be saved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202540/extras/e56e33a9e43e17f2c38d16ae4162ce30.webp?t=1787776832\" width=1199 height=35 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202540/extras/ee1ffd43247554d3141b9c6a92764414.avif?t=1787776832\" width=1200 height=304 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202540/extras/e56e33a9e43e17f2c38d16ae4162ce30.webp?t=1787776832\" width=1199 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Dive into a world consumed by the biblical apocalypse. As a fallen priest seeking redemption, battle demonic horrors, cleanse the tormented, and gather what remains to rebuild the Sanctuary of Ash - the faint light in a dying world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202540/1cf3a0d3667f8790f9fb80669dbb7a98544f6096/header.jpg?t=1787776832", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202540/df3bd68bcd74570e7b